Fantasy Tales Online is a Free to play Retro MMORPG.  It worked, looked ok, played ok, sounded ok.
Try it, you might like it.
For more info;

As a player who has more than 90 hours in game, I want to say that this game is pretty interesting at the begging, but its really raw in gameplay, as all you can do is basically change your countrie's regime(fascism, democracy...) and create an army to conquer. This game is actually not that bad, but when you play it for more than 50 hours it gets boring, as everytime its the same: 1) Choose a country; 2) Change its regime(if you want to of course); 3) Create an army, and start conquering other countries(of course if no one attacks YOU, before you have a good army);
P.s: Yeah if you want to get any achievements you have to play the game on normal difficulty(where bots in a month have an army that you wont get in a year)
To sum up I want to say that this game is too raw in gameplay, and I wouldn't recommend to buy it, unless you are going to play it with friends.

